{"id":"9eda76867b22f44658d55cf3d8df3704f8b98d9d","axis":"silent","repo":"pnpm/pnpm","sha":"9eda76867b22f44658d55cf3d8df3704f8b98d9d","parsed":{"files":[{"path":".changeset/pipeline-root-only-workspace.md","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@","+---","+\"pacquet\": patch","+---","+","+`pnpm pipeline` now runs the root's tasks when `pnpm-workspace.yaml` lists only the root in `packages` or omits `packages`, as `pnpm -r run` does. A change to a root file in such a workspace no longer triggers a full-run warning. When a full run has no projects to run, `pnpm pipeline` now reports that no projects are selected [#16849](https://github.com/pnpm/pnpm/issues/16849)."],"additions":5,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/src/cli_args/pipeline.rs","lines":["@@ -17,7 +17,7 @@ pub use selection::{Selection, SelectionMode};"," mod arguments;"," "," use super::{","-    recursive::{ExecutionStatus, Status, discover_workspace_projects},","+    recursive::{ExecutionStatus, Status, discover_workspace_projects, keeps_workspace_root},","     reporter::{ReporterType, reporter_emit},","     run::{RunContext, ScriptSelector, run_stages},"," };","@@ -135,13 +135,14 @@ pub fn run_pipeline(","     };","     let (name, requested_tasks) = run.requested_tasks()?;"," ","-    let (projects, _) = discover_workspace_projects(run.workspace_root, config)?;","+    let (projects, patterns) = discover_workspace_projects(run.workspace_root, config)?;","     let graph = build_full_graph(&projects, config)?;"," ","     let base = pipeline_base(invocation, config);","     let selection = select_affected_projects(&SelectAffectedOptions {","         graph: &graph,","         workspace_root: run.workspace_root,","+        keeps_workspace_root: keeps_workspace_root(config, patterns.as_deref()),","         base: &base,","         full: invocation.full,","         config,","@@ -156,7 +157,7 @@ pub fn run_pipeline(","     )?;"," ","     if selection.requested.is_empty() {","-        run.info(format!(\"No projects are affected since {base} — nothing to run.\"));","+        run.info(empty_selection_message(selection.mode, &base));","         return run.conclude(&report, None, 0);","     }","     run.execute(&PipelinePlan {","@@ -168,6 +169,15 @@ pub fn run_pipeline(","     })"," }"," ","+fn empty_selection_message(mode: SelectionMode, base: &str) -> String {","+    match mode {","+        SelectionMode::Affected => {","+            format!(\"No projects are affected since {base} — nothing to run.\")","+        }","+        SelectionMode::Full => \"No projects are selected — nothing to run.\".to_string(),","+    }","+}","+"," /// What every phase of one pipeline run reads."," struct PipelineRun<'a> {","     invocation: &'a PipelineInvocation,"],"additions":13,"deletions":3,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/src/cli_args/pipeline/selection.rs","lines":["@@ -48,8 +48,8 @@ pub(super) fn build_full_graph<'a>("," /// How the run decided what to cover."," pub struct Selection {","     /// The projects whose pipeline tasks the run requests: the changed","-    /// projects and their dependents. Root tasks participate when","-    /// `includeWorkspaceRoot` is enabled.","+    /// projects and their dependents, without the workspace root unless","+    /// `SelectAffectedOptions::keeps_workspace_root` is set.","     pub requested: Vec<PathBuf>,","     /// The dependency closure of `requested` — the projects the task","     /// graph spans. The extra projects participate only through","@@ -75,6 +75,8 @@ pub enum SelectionMode {"," pub(super) struct SelectAffectedOptions<'a> {","     pub(super) graph: &'a ProjectGraph<GraphPkg<'a>>,","     pub(super) workspace_root: &'a Path,","+    /// See [`keeps_workspace_root`](crate::cli_args::recursive::keeps_workspace_root).","+    pub(super) keeps_workspace_root: bool,","     pub(super) base: &'a str,","     pub(super) full: bool,","     pub(super) config: &'a Config,","@@ -86,9 +88,7 @@ pub(super) fn select_affected_projects("," ) -> miette::Result<Selection> {","     let all_dirs: Vec<PathBuf> = options.graph","         .keys()","-        .filter(|dir| {","-            options.config.include_workspace_root || dir.as_path() != options.workspace_root","-        })","+        .filter(|dir| options.keeps_workspace_root || dir.as_path() != options.workspace_root)","         .cloned()","         .collect();"," ","@@ -147,20 +147,18 @@ fn projects_with_dependents("," /// The task graph additionally spans the affected set's transitive"," /// dependencies; see [`Selection::selected`] for why."," fn with_transitive_dependencies(","-    graph: &ProjectGraph<GraphPkg<'_>>,","+    options: &SelectAffectedOptions<'_>,","     affected: &HashSet<PathBuf>,","-    workspace_root: &Path,","-    config: &Config,"," ) -> HashSet<PathBuf> {","     let mut selected = affected.clone();","     let mut stack: Vec<PathBuf> = affected.iter().cloned().collect();","     while let Some(dir) = stack.pop() {","-        let dependencies = graph","+        let dependencies = options.graph","             .get(&dir)","             .map(|node| node.dependencies.as_slice())","             .unwrap_or_default();","         for dependency in dependencies {","-            if (config.include_workspace_root || dependency.as_path() != workspace_root)","+            if (options.keeps_workspace_root || dependency.as_path() != options.workspace_root)","                 && selected.insert(dependency.clone())","             {","                 stack.push(dependency.clone());","@@ -234,11 +232,14 @@ fn select_changed_projects(","     // A changed file above every package maps to the workspace root","     // project: the root manifest, the lockfile, a shared config. Those","     // feed every project in ways project topology cannot see, so pruning","-    // is disabled for the run rather than guessed at.","-    if changed.changed_projects","-        .iter()","-        .chain(&changed.ignore_dependent_for_projects)","-        .any(|dir| dir == options.workspace_root)","+    // is disabled for the run rather than guessed at. A run over the root","+    // alone has nothing to prune.","+    let covers_only_root = matches!(all_dirs, [dir] if dir == options.workspace_root);","+    if !covers_only_root","+        && changed.changed_projects","+            .iter()","+            .chain(&changed.ignore_dependent_for_projects)","+            .any(|dir| dir == options.workspace_root)","     {","         (options.emit)(&LogEvent::Pnpm(PnpmLog {","             level: LogLevel::Warn,","@@ -277,15 +278,10 @@ fn affected_selection(","     // A project whose only changes match `testPattern` is selected itself","     // without pulling in its dependents.","     affected.extend(changed.ignore_dependent_for_projects.iter().cloned());","-    if !options.config.include_workspace_root {","+    if !options.keeps_workspace_root {","         affected.remove(options.workspace_root);","     }","-    let selected = with_transitive_dependencies(","-        options.graph,","-        &affected,","-        options.workspace_root,","-        options.config,","-    );","+    let selected = with_transitive_dependencies(options, &affected);"," ","     // In the workspace graph's deterministic order, which is the","     // dispatch tie-break order."],"additions":18,"deletions":22,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/src/cli_args/recursive.rs","lines":["@@ -93,8 +93,8 @@ pub fn find_resume_root("," /// returning them alongside the package patterns that selected them."," /// Shared by recursive `run` / `exec` / `pack` so all discover the same"," /// set before [`select_recursive_projects`] narrows it. The patterns feed","-/// the root-only guard of [`AutoExcludeRoot`]; `None` means no","-/// `pnpm-workspace.yaml` was found.","+/// [`keeps_workspace_root`]; `None` means no `pnpm-workspace.yaml` was","+/// found or `--ignore-workspace` is set."," ///"," /// The patterns come from `config.workspace_package_patterns`, already"," /// resolved from `--workspace-packages` or the manifest's `packages`.","@@ -484,7 +484,7 @@ impl AutoExcludeRoot<'_> {","         let AutoExcludeRoot::Enabled { workspace_patterns } = self else {","             return None;","         };","-        if config.include_workspace_root {","+        if keeps_workspace_root(config, *workspace_patterns) {","             return None;","         }","         // An inclusion selector already pins the selected set, so the","@@ -496,13 +496,6 @@ impl AutoExcludeRoot<'_> {","         {","             return None;","         }","-        // A root-only workspace (patterns === ['.']) has no non-root project","-        // to keep, so excluding the root would empty the selection. Absent","-        // patterns mean no `pnpm-workspace.yaml`.","-        let patterns = (*workspace_patterns)?;","-        if is_root_only_patterns(patterns) {","-            return None;","-        }","         Some(format!(\"!{{{}}}\", relative_workspace_dir(config, prefix)))","     }"," }","@@ -517,6 +510,19 @@ fn relative_workspace_dir(config: &Config, prefix: &Path) -> String {","         .unwrap_or_else(|| \".\".to_string())"," }"," ","+/// Whether a selection that names no project keeps the workspace root. It","+/// does when any of these hold:","+///","+/// - `includeWorkspaceRoot` is set.","+/// - `workspace_patterns` lists only the root, so excluding it would empty","+///   the selection.","+/// - `workspace_patterns` is `None`: there is no `pnpm-workspace.yaml`, or","+///   `--ignore-workspace` is set and the root is kept alongside every","+///   nested project.","+pub(crate) fn keeps_workspace_root(config: &Config, workspace_patterns: Option<&[String]>) -> bool {","+    config.include_workspace_root || workspace_patterns.is_none_or(is_root_only_patterns)","+}","+"," /// Whether the workspace enumerates the root project only."," fn is_root_only_patterns(patterns: &[String]) -> bool {","     patterns.len() == 1 && patterns[0] == \".\""],"additions":16,"deletions":10,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/tests/suite/main.rs","lines":["@@ -128,6 +128,7 @@ mod ping;"," mod pipeline_cache;"," mod pipeline_cargo_cache;"," mod pipeline_remote_cache;","+mod pipeline_selection;"," mod pipeline_watch;"," mod pkg_recursive;"," mod pnpm_cli_cmd_shim;"],"additions":1,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/tests/suite/pipeline_cache.rs","lines":["@@ -67,70 +67,6 @@ fn configured_environment_changes_invalidate_task_outputs() {","     }"," }"," ","-#[test]","-fn affected_selection_keeps_an_enabled_workspace_root_dependent() {","-    let root = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();","-    let fixture = pnpm_testing_utils::git_repo::GitRepoFixture::init(root.path(), \"demo\");","-    fixture.write_file(\"package.json\", r#\"{\"name\":\"root\",\"private\":true,\"scripts\":{\"build\":\"echo root\"},\"dependencies\":{\"dep\":\"workspace:*\"}}\"#);","-    fixture.write_file(\"pnpm-workspace.yaml\", \"packages: [pkg]\\nincludeWorkspaceRoot: true\\npipelines:\\n  default: [build]\\ntasks:\\n  build:\\n    dependsOn: []\\n\");","-    fixture.write_file(","-        \"pkg/package.json\",","-        r#\"{\"name\":\"dep\",\"version\":\"1.0.0\",\"scripts\":{\"build\":\"echo dep\"}}\"#,","-    );","-    fixture.write_file(\"pkg/source\", \"first\");","-    let base = fixture.commit(\"initial\");","-    fixture.write_file(\"pkg/source\", \"second\");","-    let result = Command::cargo_bin(\"pnpm\")","-        .unwrap()","-        .without_ambient_pnpm_config()","-        .current_dir(root.path().join(\"demo-src\"))","-        .env(\"XDG_CONFIG_HOME\", root.path().join(\"config\"))","-        .args([\"pipeline\", \"--base\", &base, \"--dry-run\", \"--json\"])","-        .assert()","-        .success();","-    let document: serde_json::Value = serde_json::from_slice(&result.get_output().stdout).unwrap();","-    assert!(","-        document[\"tasks\"]","-            .as_array()","-            .unwrap()","-            .iter()","-            .any(|task| task[\"project\"] == \".\" && task[\"script\"] == \"build\"),","-        \"root dependent must participate: {document}\",","-    );","-}","-","-#[test]","-fn affected_selection_keeps_the_workspace_root_as_an_upstream_dependency() {","-    let root = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();","-    let fixture = pnpm_testing_utils::git_repo::GitRepoFixture::init(root.path(), \"demo\");","-    fixture.write_file(","-        \"package.json\",","-        r#\"{\"name\":\"root\",\"version\":\"1.0.0\",\"private\":true,\"scripts\":{\"build\":\"echo root\"}}\"#,","-    );","-    fixture.write_file(\"pnpm-workspace.yaml\", \"packages: [pkg]\\nincludeWorkspaceRoot: true\\npipelines:\\n  default: [build]\\ntasks:\\n  build:\\n    dependsOn: ['^build']\\n\");","-    fixture.write_file(\"pkg/package.json\", r#\"{\"name\":\"dep\",\"version\":\"1.0.0\",\"scripts\":{\"build\":\"echo dep\"},\"dependencies\":{\"root\":\"workspace:*\"}}\"#);","-    fixture.write_file(\"pkg/source\", \"first\");","-    let base = fixture.commit(\"initial\");","-    fixture.write_file(\"pkg/source\", \"second\");","-    let result = Command::cargo_bin(\"pnpm\")","-        .unwrap()","-        .without_ambient_pnpm_config()","-        .current_dir(root.path().join(\"demo-src\"))","-        .env(\"XDG_CONFIG_HOME\", root.path().join(\"config\"))","-        .args([\"pipeline\", \"--base\", &base, \"--dry-run\", \"--json\"])","-        .assert()","-        .success();","-    let document: serde_json::Value = serde_json::from_slice(&result.get_output().stdout).unwrap();","-    assert!(","-        document[\"tasks\"]","-            .as_array()","-            .unwrap()","-            .iter()","-            .any(|task| task[\"project\"] == \".\" && task[\"script\"] == \"build\"),","-        \"root dependency must participate: {document}\",","-    );","-}","-"," #[test]"," fn dry_run_prints_the_graph_without_executing_workspace_code() {","     let project = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();"],"additions":0,"deletions":64,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/tests/suite/pipeline_selection.rs","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,156 @@","+use assert_cmd::{assert::Assert, prelude::*};","+use pnpm_testing_utils::{command_env::CommandTestExt, git_repo::GitRepoFixture};","+use std::{fs, path::Path, process::Command};","+","+const ROOT_MANIFEST: &str = r#\"{\"name\":\"root\",\"version\":\"1.0.0\",\"scripts\":{\"build\":\"echo root\"}}\"#;","+","+fn pipeline(project: &Path, config_home: &Path, args: &[&str]) -> Assert {","+    Command::cargo_bin(\"pnpm\")","+        .unwrap()","+        .without_ambient_pnpm_config()","+        .current_dir(project)","+        .env(\"XDG_CONFIG_HOME\", config_home)","+        .env(\"XDG_CACHE_HOME\", config_home.join(\"cache\"))","+        .arg(\"pipeline\")","+        .args(args)","+        .assert()","+        .success()","+}","+","+fn runs_root_build(document: &serde_json::Value) -> bool {","+    document[\"tasks\"]","+        .as_array()","+        .unwrap()","+        .iter()","+        .any(|task| task[\"project\"] == \".\" && task[\"script\"] == \"build\")","+}","+","+fn changed_pkg_selection(","+    root_manifest: &str,","+    pkg_manifest: &str,","+    settings: &str,","+) -> serde_json::Value {","+    let root = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();","+    let fixture = GitRepoFixture::init(root.path(), \"demo\");","+    fixture.write_file(\"package.json\", root_manifest);","+    fixture.write_file(","+        \"pnpm-workspace.yaml\",","+        &format!(\"packages: [pkg]\\nincludeWorkspaceRoot: true\\npipelines:\\n  default: [build]\\n{settings}\"),","+    );","+    fixture.write_file(\"pkg/package.json\", pkg_manifest);","+    fixture.write_file(\"pkg/source\", \"first\");","+    let base = fixture.commit(\"initial\");","+    fixture.write_file(\"pkg/source\", \"second\");","+    let result = pipeline(","+        &root.path().join(\"demo-src\"),","+        &root.path().join(\"config\"),","+        &[\"--base\", &base, \"--dry-run\", \"--json\"],","+    );","+    serde_json::from_slice(&result.get_output().stdout).unwrap()","+}","+","+#[test]","+fn affected_selection_keeps_an_enabled_workspace_root_dependent() {","+    let document = changed_pkg_selection(","+        r#\"{\"name\":\"root\",\"private\":true,\"scripts\":{\"build\":\"echo root\"},\"dependencies\":{\"dep\":\"workspace:*\"}}\"#,","+        r#\"{\"name\":\"dep\",\"version\":\"1.0.0\",\"scripts\":{\"build\":\"echo dep\"}}\"#,","+        \"tasks:\\n  build:\\n    dependsOn: []\\n\",","+    );","+    assert!(runs_root_build(&document), \"root dependent must participate: {document}\");","+}","+","+#[test]","+fn affected_selection_keeps_the_workspace_root_as_an_upstream_dependency() {","+    let document = changed_pkg_selection(","+        r#\"{\"name\":\"root\",\"version\":\"1.0.0\",\"private\":true,\"scripts\":{\"build\":\"echo root\"}}\"#,","+        r#\"{\"name\":\"dep\",\"version\":\"1.0.0\",\"scripts\":{\"build\":\"echo dep\"},\"dependencies\":{\"root\":\"workspace:*\"}}\"#,","+        \"tasks:\\n  build:\\n    dependsOn: ['^build']\\n\",","+    );","+    assert!(runs_root_build(&document), \"root dependency must participate: {document}\");","+}","+","+#[test]","+fn a_root_only_workspace_selects_the_root() {","+    for packages in [\"packages: ['.']\\n\", \"\"] {","+        let project = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();","+        fs::write(project.path().join(\"package.json\"), ROOT_MANIFEST).unwrap();","+        fs::write(","+            project.path().join(\"pnpm-workspace.yaml\"),","+            format!(\"{packages}pipelines:\\n  default: [build]\\n\"),","+        )","+        .unwrap();","+        let result = pipeline(","+            project.path(),","+            &project.path().join(\"config\"),","+            &[\"--full\", \"--dry-run\", \"--json\"],","+        );","+        let document: serde_json::Value =","+            serde_json::from_slice(&result.get_output().stdout).unwrap();","+        assert!(","+            runs_root_build(&document),","+            \"the root must participate with {packages:?}: {document}\",","+        );","+    }","+}","+","+fn pipeline_after_root_change(workspace_manifest: &str, args: &[&str]) -> Assert {","+    let root = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();","+    let fixture = GitRepoFixture::init(root.path(), \"demo\");","+    fixture.write_file(\"package.json\", ROOT_MANIFEST);","+    fixture.write_file(\"pnpm-workspace.yaml\", workspace_manifest);","+    fixture.write_file(","+        \"pkg/package.json\",","+        r#\"{\"name\":\"pkg\",\"version\":\"1.0.0\",\"scripts\":{\"build\":\"echo pkg\"}}\"#,","+    );","+    fixture.write_file(\"source\", \"first\");","+    let base = fixture.commit(\"initial\");","+    fixture.write_file(\"source\", \"second\");","+    let args: Vec<&str> = [\"--base\", &base]","+        .into_iter()","+        .chain(args.iter().copied())","+        .collect();","+    pipeline(&root.path().join(\"demo-src\"), &root.path().join(\"config\"), &args)","+}","+","+#[test]","+fn a_root_only_workspace_selects_the_root_for_a_change() {","+    for packages in [\"packages: ['.']\\n\", \"\"] {","+        let result = pipeline_after_root_change(","+            &format!(\"{packages}pipelines:\\n  default: [build]\\n\"),","+            &[\"--dry-run\", \"--json\"],","+        );","+        let stdout = &result.get_output().stdout;","+        let text = String::from_utf8_lossy(stdout);","+        assert!(!text.contains(\"The diff touches workspace-root files\"), \"{text}\");","+        let document: serde_json::Value = serde_json::from_slice(stdout).unwrap();","+        assert!(","+            runs_root_build(&document),","+            \"the root must participate with {packages:?}: {document}\",","+        );","+    }","+}","+","+#[test]","+fn a_root_change_in_a_workspace_with_projects_runs_every_project() {","+    let result = pipeline_after_root_change(","+        \"packages: [pkg]\\npipelines:\\n  default: [build]\\n\",","+        &[\"--dry-run\"],","+    );","+    let output = String::from_utf8_lossy(&result.get_output().stdout).into_owned();","+    assert!(output.contains(\"The diff touches workspace-root files\"), \"{output}\");","+    assert!(output.contains(\"pkg#build\"), \"{output}\");","+}","+","+#[test]","+fn an_empty_full_selection_reports_no_selected_projects() {","+    let project = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();","+    fs::write(project.path().join(\"package.json\"), ROOT_MANIFEST).unwrap();","+    fs::write(","+        project.path().join(\"pnpm-workspace.yaml\"),","+        \"packages: ['packages/*']\\npipelines:\\n  default: [build]\\n\",","+    )","+    .unwrap();","+    let result = pipeline(project.path(), &project.path().join(\"config\"), &[\"--full\", \"--dry-run\"]);","+    let output = String::from_utf8_lossy(&result.get_output().stdout).into_owned();","+    assert!(output.contains(\"No projects are selected — nothing to run.\"), \"{output}\");","+}"],"additions":156,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/docs/cli/pipeline.md","lines":["@@ -52,7 +52,7 @@ pnpm pipeline release  # build only"," 4. Restores each cacheable task whose key it has seen before, and runs the rest."," 5. Keeps going after a task fails, so one run reports every failure rather than the first."," ","-The workspace root is left out of the selection unless [`includeWorkspaceRoot`](../workspaces.md#includeworkspaceroot) is `true`.","+The workspace root is left out of the selection unless [`includeWorkspaceRoot`](../workspaces.md#includeworkspaceroot) is `true`, or `packages` is omitted or lists only the root."," "," Use `--dry-run` to see the graph without installing configuration dependencies, running workspace hooks, or executing anything. Add `--json` for the nodes and edges."," ",""],"additions":1,"deletions":1,"truncated":false}],"additions":210,"deletions":100,"truncated":false,"file_count":8},"error":null,"fetched_at":"2026-10-13T15:27:35.802060+00:00"}